[{:db/id "q-318630/selection/95f63c11f99a5015c1f73558576052145e00c1cfbb1718f78cf554be0ab200f9" :answer/id #uuid "43e766ba-1977-5f22-b198-6205741239e7" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I and II only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-318630/selection/df67a18079e3b7b726c109ae1bf07ae161d9f6d37a928c50361c8787d74f7981" :answer/id #uuid "79b13e61-3f09-5a7e-99bb-eac48251f987" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "II only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-318630/selection/6a87b4860f595a380edef797b2cc43b24d4896fc51da713259b980588721456c" :answer/id #uuid "ca4ca63b-e7c1-5af8-82c1-bca687da48fa" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-318630/selection/5b26512916f768e66a2b0af106e5aa3e2ff7ee012277d9669a26d349c343f77b" :answer/id #uuid "4c49047e-e96a-56a2-b620-1e257a622a65" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-318630/selection/431472f1dab61ef54de031c09a96fb6a21dc69c8bc09f12797d1d686e8c9e8e6" :answer/id #uuid "ce1c208e-1795-599f-a7c0-ba461be4a7f8" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I and III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-318630/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "9d0b19d8-cbca-5872-8304-630cd1975f10" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-318630/selection/5b26512916f768e66a2b0af106e5aa3e2ff7ee012277d9669a26d349c343f77b" :answer-field/choices ["q-318630/selection/95f63c11f99a5015c1f73558576052145e00c1cfbb1718f78cf554be0ab200f9" "q-318630/selection/df67a18079e3b7b726c109ae1bf07ae161d9f6d37a928c50361c8787d74f7981" "q-318630/selection/6a87b4860f595a380edef797b2cc43b24d4896fc51da713259b980588721456c" "q-318630/selection/5b26512916f768e66a2b0af106e5aa3e2ff7ee012277d9669a26d349c343f77b" "q-318630/selection/431472f1dab61ef54de031c09a96fb6a21dc69c8bc09f12797d1d686e8c9e8e6"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-318630" :question/id #uuid "5f5d0a5b-358b-5167-8c1b-732bb9d009dd" :question/math-academy-id "q-318630" :question/problem "Which of the following differential equations is exact?  \n\n- $(2xy+5)\\,\\text{d}x+({x}^{2}+7)\\,\\text{d}y=0$\n- $({y}^{2}+x)\\,\\text{d}x+(xy+1)\\,\\text{d}y=0$\n- $(5y-3x)\\,\\text{d}y-(y-2x)\\,\\text{d}x=0$" :question/worked-solution "A differential equation of the form\n\n$$\nP(x,y)\\text{d}x+Q(x,y)\\text{d}y=0\n$$\n\nis exact if it passes the exactness test, i.e.,\n\n$$\n\\frac{∂P}{∂y}=\\frac{∂Q}{∂x}.\n$$\n\nNow, let's consider each equation:\n\n- The first equation is\n\n$$\n(2xy+5)\\,\\text{d}x+({x}^{2}+7)\\,\\text{d}y=0.\n$$\n\n \nTherefore, the functions $P$ and $Q$ are\n\n$$\nP(x,y)=2xy+5,\\,Q(x,y)={x}^{2}+7.\n$$\n\nNow, let's compute the partial derivatives:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂P}{∂y} & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}(2xy+5) \\\\  & =2x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂Q}{∂x} & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}({x}^{2}+7) \\\\  & =2x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo,\n\n$$\n\\frac{∂P}{∂y}=\\frac{∂Q}{∂x}.\\,✓\n$$\n\n \nThus, equation I is exact.\n\n- The second equation is\n\n$$\n({y}^{2}+x)\\,\\text{d}x+(xy+1)\\,\\text{d}y=0.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the functions $P$ and $Q$ are\n\n$$\nP(x,y)={y}^{2}+x,\\,Q(x,y)=xy+1.\n$$\n\nNow, let's compute the partial derivatives:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂P}{∂y} & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}({y}^{2}+x) \\\\  & =2y\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂Q}{∂x} & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(xy+1) \\\\  & =y\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo,\n\n$$\n\\frac{∂P}{∂y}\\ne \\frac{∂Q}{∂x}.\\,\\times \n$$\n\nThus, equation II is not exact.\n\n- The third equation is\n\n$$\n(5y-3x)\\,\\text{d}y-(y-2x)\\,\\text{d}x=0.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the functions $P$ and $Q$ are\n\n$$\nP(x,y)=-(y-2x)=2x-y,\\,Q(x,y)=5y-3x.\n$$\n\nNow, let's compute the partial derivatives:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂P}{∂y} & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}(2x-y) \\\\  & =-1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂Q}{∂x} & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(5y-3x) \\\\  & =-3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \nSo,\n\n$$\n\\frac{∂P}{∂y}\\ne \\frac{∂Q}{∂x}.\\,\\times \n$$\n\nThus, equation III is not exact.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I only\"." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-318630/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "df3a798c-f226-5b4f-8d65-4a305de2b087"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-318630"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-318601/field-1/815f108c5cae8f6afa96a286d6aa8aab2026634c15a889f8491d95a153c4bce6" :answer/id #uuid "7055ca9f-ac98-5cbc-a77f-c678def961d0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{{∂}^{2}P}{∂{s}^{2}}=\\frac{{∂}^{2}Q}{∂{r}^{2}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-318601/field-1/6995fb3a10e1a9a4f1e9259c21712d37184a163668d055cd9cc8ed890cd684d3" :answer/id #uuid "7f922dbb-0320-5b0c-ae61-0808e5295f80" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{∂P}{∂s}=\\frac{∂Q}{∂r}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-318601/field-1/5a53dd5f33393c5292fd7f268196a4024b1d68b7cfaa59236becfaceb342576b" :answer/id #uuid "84a3a581-694d-5109-9da6-450c1d1411f1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{∂P}{∂r}=-\\frac{∂Q}{∂s}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-318601/field-1/f6447b9cc91b74fd7bd0dc3507b9be879db8357d96af62e5fec9bad97d8fc2f7" :answer/id #uuid "5bc5269e-05e9-50f4-8dec-812e6982b076" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{∂P}{∂r}=\\frac{∂Q}{∂s}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-318601/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "59cd9242-e478-590f-9527-30834986875c" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "q-318601/field-1/6995fb3a10e1a9a4f1e9259c21712d37184a163668d055cd9cc8ed890cd684d3" :answer-field/choices ["q-318601/field-1/815f108c5cae8f6afa96a286d6aa8aab2026634c15a889f8491d95a153c4bce6" "q-318601/field-1/6995fb3a10e1a9a4f1e9259c21712d37184a163668d055cd9cc8ed890cd684d3" "q-318601/field-1/5a53dd5f33393c5292fd7f268196a4024b1d68b7cfaa59236becfaceb342576b" "q-31860