d "q-318601/field-6/6995fb3a10e1a9a4f1e9259c21712d37184a163668d055cd9cc8ed890cd684d3" :answer/id #uuid "9847eeb5-ea2b-5058-aaba-83be7811f8f8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{∂P}{∂s}=\\frac{∂Q}{∂r}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-318601/field-6/22f23c631d3886355a38f0fc3d88dc4ac6d820d99eb50d09be27eb68160c1d56" :answer/id #uuid "3ab1f178-2cd5-5c45-98c7-d5f67ab8cc3c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{∂P}{∂s}\\ne \\frac{∂Q}{∂r}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-318601/field-6" :answer-field/id #uuid "55933418-f471-5571-86b3-3f9be211a12d" :answer-field/key "field-6" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "q-318601/field-6/6995fb3a10e1a9a4f1e9259c21712d37184a163668d055cd9cc8ed890cd684d3" :answer-field/choices ["q-318601/field-6/6995fb3a10e1a9a4f1e9259c21712d37184a163668d055cd9cc8ed890cd684d3" "q-318601/field-6/22f23c631d3886355a38f0fc3d88dc4ac6d820d99eb50d09be27eb68160c1d56"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-318601/field-7/2f4a8327029b03da8f8afc132759dda7a70ededaadd9c5c454614983e04742c5" :answer/id #uuid "e57b7b6c-15e4-5c84-aaf6-f9212e746656" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "is exact" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-318601/field-7/e428a675e4ebcb091b4b5a58c4cd37c477c66b330eb5617a5e376c7e9900b5c4" :answer/id #uuid "74d8eb8c-3628-5df3-b557-ad336e89906e" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "is not exact" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-318601/field-7" :answer-field/id #uuid "b2cff2fa-18ec-55ff-8eb6-d55460e81bd4" :answer-field/key "field-7" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "q-318601/field-7/2f4a8327029b03da8f8afc132759dda7a70ededaadd9c5c454614983e04742c5" :answer-field/choices ["q-318601/field-7/2f4a8327029b03da8f8afc132759dda7a70ededaadd9c5c454614983e04742c5" "q-318601/field-7/e428a675e4ebcb091b4b5a58c4cd37c477c66b330eb5617a5e376c7e9900b5c4"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-318601" :question/id #uuid "6db88e5d-0b4c-539e-9588-685be1e9680f" :question/math-academy-id "q-318601" :question/problem "Determine whether the following differential equation is exact:\n\n$$\n(1-s{e}^{rs})\\,\\text{d}r+(-r{e}^{rs}+4s)\\,\\text{d}s=0\n$$\n\nA differential equation of the form\n\n$$\nP(r,s)\\,\\text{d}r+Q(r,s)\\,\\text{d}s=0\n$$\n\nis exact if it satisfies the condition\n\n$$\n\\,{{field-1}},\n$$\n\nFor the equation $(1-s{e}^{rs})\\,\\text{d}r+(-r{e}^{rs}+4s)\\,\\text{d}s=0$, we have  \n\n$$\nP=\\,{{field-2}},\n$$\n\n$$\nQ=\\,{{field-3}}.\n$$\n\nTherefore,  \n\n$$\n\\frac{∂P}{∂s}=\\,{{field-4}},\n$$\n\n$$\n\\frac{∂Q}{∂r}=\\,{{field-5}}.\n$$\n\nNow, since \n\n$$\n\\,{{field-6}},\n$$\n\n the equation {{field-7}}." :question/worked-solution "A differential equation of the form\n\n$$\nP(r,s)\\,\\text{d}r+Q(r,s)\\,\\text{d}s=0\n$$\n\nis exact if it passes the exactness test, i.e.,\n\n$$\n\\frac{∂P}{∂s}=\\frac{∂Q}{∂r}.\n$$\n\nFor the equation $(1-s{e}^{rs})\\,\\text{d}r+(-r{e}^{rs}+4s)\\,\\text{d}s=0$, we have  \n\n$$\nP(r,s)=1-s{e}^{rs},\\,Q(r,s)=-r{e}^{rs}+4s.\n$$\n\nNow, we compute the partial derivatives:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂P}{∂s} & =\\frac{∂}{∂s}(1-s{e}^{rs}) \\\\  & =-\\,({e}^{rs}+rs{e}^{rs}),\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂Q}{∂r} & =\\frac{∂}{∂r}(-r{e}^{rs}+4s) \\\\  & =-\\,({e}^{rs}+rs{e}^{rs}).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, since\n\n$$\n\\frac{∂P}{∂s}=\\frac{∂Q}{∂r},\n$$\n\nthe exactness condition is satisfied. Therefore, the given differential equation $\\text{is exact}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-318601/field-1" "q-318601/field-2" "q-318601/field-3" "q-318601/field-4" "q-318601/field-5" "q-318601/field-6" "q-318601/field-7"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "df3a798c-f226-5b4f-8d65-4a305de2b087"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-318601"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-320450/field-1/9c44427e383f745d3d2736ffbed717e19f39a625a7dbc6f